  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">5969 Senegal NAP GCF Readiness Linking National and subnational adaptation planning in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The proposed project paves the way for a two-way adaptation planning process combining top-down and bottom-up approaches in Senegal. It associates in its efforts existing NAP support initiatives, to address specifically, barriers related to vertical adaptation planning, implementation and M&amp;E. Resources will be used to reinforce national and sub-national climate change coordination mechanisms, formulate a National Adaptation Plan informed by sectoral and local needs, and finally equip sub-natio</narrative>
  </description>
